---
/* [FEAT-CON09] 全站公告：配置随静态产物发布，生效窗口与关闭记忆在浏览器按 UTC 判断。 */
import { useT, type Locale } from '../i18n';
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../lib/site-config';

interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}

const { locale } = Astro.props;
const t = useT(locale);
const announcement = SITE_CONFIG.announcement;
const text = announcement.text[locale]?.trim();
const renderable = announcement.enabled && Boolean(text) && Boolean(announcement.id);
const externalHref = announcement.href?.startsWith('https://');
---

{
  renderable && (
    <aside
      id="x-announcement"
      class="announcement"
      data-id={announcement.id}
      data-starts-at={announcement.startsAt ?? ''}
      data-ends-at={announcement.endsAt ?? ''}
      hidden
    >
      <div class="inner">
        {announcement.href ? (
          <a
            class="message"
            href={announcement.href}
            title={text}
            target={externalHref ? '_blank' : undefined}
            rel={externalHref ? 'noopener noreferrer' : undefined}
          >{text}<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a>
        ) : (
          <span class="message" title={text}>{text}</span>
        )}
        <button type="button" class="close" aria-label={t('trust.certClose')} data-announcement-close>
          <span aria-hidden="true">×</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </aside>
  )
}

<script is:inline>
  (function () {
    var root = document.getElementById('x-announcement');
    if (!root) return;
    var dismissKey = 'x-announcement-dismissed';
    var timer = 0;

    function dismissed() {
      try { return sessionStorage.getItem(dismissKey) === root.dataset.id; }
      catch (_) { return false; }
    }

    function timeValue(value) {
      if (!value) return null;
      var parsed = Date.parse(value);
      return isFinite(parsed) ? parsed : null;
    }

    function syncOffset() {
      var screenHeight = root.hidden ? 0 : root.getBoundingClientRect().height;
      var canvas = document.querySelector('.x-canvas');
      var zoom = canvas && canvas.offsetWidth ? canvas.getBoundingClientRect().width / canvas.offsetWidth : 1;
      if (!(zoom > 0) || !isFinite(zoom)) zoom = 1;
      document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--x-announcement-screen-h', screenHeight + 'px');
      document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--x-announcement-h', screenHeight / zoom + 'px');
    }

    function refresh() {
      clearTimeout(timer);
      var now = Date.now();
      var starts = timeValue(root.dataset.startsAt);
      var ends = timeValue(root.dataset.endsAt);
      var inWindow = (starts === null || now >= starts) && (ends === null || now < ends);
      root.hidden = dismissed() || !inWindow;
      requestAnimationFrame(syncOffset);

      var next = starts !== null && now < starts ? starts : ends !== null && now < ends ? ends : null;
      if (next !== null) timer = setTimeout(refresh, Math.min(2147483647, Math.max(20, next - now + 20)));
    }

    root.querySelector('[data-announcement-close]')?.addEventListener('click', function () {
      try { sessionStorage.setItem(dismissKey, root.dataset.id || ''); } catch (_) { /* 会话存储不可用时只关闭本页 */ }
      root.hidden = true;
      syncOffset();
    });
    addEventListener('resize', function () { requestAnimationFrame(syncOffset); }, { passive: true });
    if ('ResizeObserver' in window) new ResizeObserver(syncOffset).observe(root);
    refresh();
  })();
</script>

<style>
  .announcement {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0 0 auto;
    z-index: 45;
    background: var(--x-accent);
    color: var(--x-on-accent);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--x-bg-rgb) / 0.22);
  }
  .announcement[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }
  .inner {
    min-height: 44px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding-inline: max(12px, var(--x-pad));
  }
  .message {
    display: inline-block;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding-block: calc((44px - 1.6em) / 2);
    min-width: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: inherit;
    font-family: var(--x-font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  a.message:hover,
  a.message:focus-visible {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
  }
  .close {
    flex: 0 0 44px;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    color: inherit;
    font: 24px/1 var(--x-font-display);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .close:hover,
  .close:focus-visible {
    background: rgb(var(--x-bg-rgb) / 0.12);
  }
</style>
